SACAL 1.0 — 源可用自定义许可证（中英对照 / Bilingual）
========================================================

Source-Available Custom Attribution License
（本许可证为自定义"源可用"许可证，不属于 Creative Commons 体系，
 NOT part of Creative Commons; NOT OSI-approved open source.）


一、版权与授权 / Copyright & Grant
-----------------------------------

本软件（含同一仓库内各独立作品 / 扩展）的著作权归各自原作者所有。
The copyright of each work (including each independent extension in the
same repository) belongs to its original author.

在遵守署名义务的前提下，授予使用者以下权利（不受领域、商用、托管限制）：
Subject to the attribution requirement below, you are granted the following
rights, WITHOUT any field, commercial, or hosting restriction:

  (a) 复制、修改、合并、发布、分发、再许可、销售本软件；
      reproduce, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, sell;
  (b) 以源码或目标代码形式使用本软件；
      use in source or object form;
  (c) 将本软件用于任何用途，包括商业用途与网络托管/服务化部署。
      use for any purpose, including commercial use and SaaS/hosting.


二、署名义务（核心条款）/ Attribution Requirement (the core term)
------------------------------------------------------------------

每个作品（扩展）均须清晰标示以下两项信息，二者须各自独立、不得合并或替换：
Each work (extension) MUST clearly identify TWO pieces of information,
kept SEPARATE (neither merged nor replaced):

  (a) 作品名        the WORK NAME
  (b) 作者（著作权人） the AUTHOR (copyright holder)

推荐形式（仅供参考，非唯一合法形式；填写方式可自行决定，只要两项信息清晰可辨）：
Recommended form (reference only; the exact format is flexible):

  Powered by <作品名>（<作者名>）
  Project URL: <网址>          ← 可选项，独立成行
                                  (optional, on a separate line)

  没有网址不构成免除署名义务的理由。
  Absence of a URL does NOT excuse the attribution obligation.

署名须体现在：(1) 作品界面 / UI；(2) 随附的许可证 / 版权声明；(3) 源码文件头部注释。
Attribution MUST appear in: (1) the UI; (2) the licence/copyright notice;
(3) the header comment of source files.

署名锁定 / Non-replaceable
--------------------------
作品名与作者名均指该作品的原始名称与原始著作权人，不得被 fork 方、分发者、
代发方或任何第三方替换、移除、遮挡或虚假署名。修改者可追加自身署名，
但不得移除或替换原始署名。
The work name and author name refer to the ORIGINAL name and ORIGINAL
copyright holder. They MUST NOT be replaced, removed, obscured, or falsely
attributed by any fork, distributor, or third party. A modifier may APPEND
its own attribution but MUST NOT remove or replace the original.


三、代发方 / 发布者（Distributor / Publisher）
------------------------------------------------

ST工作室（ST Studio）为本软件的代发方 / 发布者，仅负责分发与托管，
不作为各作品的原作者，亦不取代任何作品的署名。
ST Studio is the distributor / publisher, handling distribution and hosting
only. It is NOT the original author of any work and MUST NOT replace any
work's attribution.

代发方可在独立的"发布者 / Published by"位置标示自身，但不得将该标示混入或
替代作品的"作品名 + 作者"署名。
ST Studio may appear at a SEPARATE "Published by" line, but MUST NOT mix
that label into, or substitute it for, the work's own "work name + author".

代发方不得代为填写署名，亦不得替作者决定作者名。
The distributor MUST NOT fill in attributions or decide the author on behalf
of any author.


四、免责声明 / Disclaimer
-------------------------

本软件按"现状"提供，不提供任何明示或暗示的担保。
THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND.

本软件为独立第三方作品，除非明确声明，否则与 Scratch Foundation 及
TurboWarp 项目无隶属、授权或派生关系。
This is an independent third-party work; unless explicitly stated, it is NOT
affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from Scratch Foundation or the
TurboWarp project.

不得在产品名、图标中使用"TurboWarp""Scratch Cat"等官方标识；
描述兼容性时（如"用于 TurboWarp"）属合理使用。
Do NOT use official marks (e.g. "TurboWarp", "Scratch Cat") in product names
or icons; describing compatibility (e.g. "for TurboWarp") is fair use.


五、终止与再授权 / Termination & Reinstatement
-----------------------------------------------

违反署名义务（含替换、移除、遮挡署名）即自动终止本许可证授予的全部权利；
经书面或公开通知后 30 日内补正并恢复署名的可恢复授权。
Breach of the attribution requirement (including replacement, removal, or
obscuring of attribution) automatically terminates the rights granted.
Rights are reinstated if the violation is cured within 30 days of written
or public notice.


六、适用法与可分性 / Governing Law & Severability
--------------------------------------------------

本协议受中华人民共和国法律管辖；条款部分无效不影响其余效力。
Governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China. If any provision is
held invalid, the remaining provisions remain in full force.


--- 署名示例 / Attribution example -----------------------------------------

  作品名：box2d-physics     作者名：张三
  Work name: box2d-physics  Author: Zhang San

  界面显示 / UI display:
      Powered by box2d-physics（张三）
      Project URL: https://example.com/box2d   （可选 / optional）

  文件头部注释 / File header:
      // 作品名：box2d-physics  作者：张三
      // Powered by box2d-physics（张三）

--- 使用 / Usage ----------------------------------------------------------

  1. 每个作品（扩展）一个目录，目录名即作品名；
     One directory per work (extension); the directory name IS the work name.
  2. 在作品目录内放置本 LICENSE，把开头的"作品名 / 作者名"改为该作品自己的；
     Place this LICENSE next to the work; change "Work name / Author" above
     to THAT work's own.
  3. 在界面显示：Powered by <作品名>（<作者名>）。
     Display: Powered by <work name> (<author>).

  不需要集中清单，也不需要脚本；没有固定目录结构要求——
  只要"作品名 + 作者"两项能辨识，条款即适用。
  No central list, no script, no fixed directory structure required.
  The terms apply as long as "work name + author" are identifiable.
